<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFrameworks>net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<Version>0.3.0</Version>
		<PackageId>Serilog.TechTeaStudio.Wrap</PackageId>
		<Authors>Ronald Ryan</Authors>
		<Company>Tech Tea Studio</Company>
		<Description>A logging library for .NET applications using Serilog, providing easy configuration and integration.</Description>
		<PackageTags>Serilog, Logging, DependencyInjection, .NET</PackageTags>
		<Copyright>Copyright © Tech Tea Studio 2026</Copyright>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/IoannTerrible/Serilog.TechTeaStudio.Wrap</RepositoryUrl>
		<ProjectUrl>https://github.com/IoannTerrible/Serilog.TechTeaStudio.Wrap</ProjectUrl>
		<PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
		<GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
		<NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<PropertyGroup>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>
v0.3.0 — Sink callback and JSON formatter.

Added:
  * LoggerOptions.ConfigureLogger — Action&lt;LoggerConfiguration&gt; callback for attaching extra sinks (Seq, Elastic, Application Insights, Loki) and enrichers. Invoked after built-in console/file sinks are wired, before CreateLogger().
  * LoggerOptions.UseJsonFormatter — when true, built-in sinks emit one CompactJsonFormatter line per event (ready for log aggregators). OutputTemplate is ignored in this mode.
  * New dependency: Serilog.Formatting.Compact 3.0.0.

Fixed:
  * README API section referenced removed Flush()/FlushAsync() methods — now correctly documents Logger.Shutdown()/ShutdownAsync().

v0.2.1 — Configurable file size limit.

Added:
  * LoggerOptions.FileSizeLimitBytes (default 1 GB, null = unlimited).
  * LoggerOptions.RollOnFileSizeLimit (default false) — roll into a new file when the size limit is hit.

Fixed:
  * README configuration table now lists all LoggerOptions properties and the corrected MinimumLevel default.

v0.2.0 — Major refactor.

Added:
  * Microsoft.Extensions.Logging integration — ILogger&lt;T&gt; resolves from DI and writes through Serilog.
  * AddLogger(IConfiguration, ...) overload for appsettings.json binding.
  * Console sink (on by default) and configurable RetainedFileCountLimit (default 31).
  * Single rolling-file mode is the new default; per-level files are opt-in via SeparateFilesPerLevel.
  * Global AssemblyVersion enricher (cached, attached to every event).
  * xUnit test project covering options, DI, and end-to-end writes.

Changed:
  * No longer mutates global Serilog.Log.Logger — the built ILogger is registered as a DI singleton.
  * Logger is sealed; ILoggerConfig.Build(options) replaces Configure() (legacy method kept and marked obsolete).
  * Invariant-culture filenames; output template uses [{Level:u3}].
  * Stable dependencies pinned: Serilog 4.2.0, Serilog.Sinks.File 6.0.0, Serilog.Sinks.Console 6.0.0, Serilog.Extensions.Logging 9.0.0.
  * Default MinimumLevel: Verbose -&gt; Information.

Breaking:
  * Logger.Flush()/FlushAsync() (instance) -&gt; Logger.Shutdown()/ShutdownAsync() (static).
  * Two-arg Logger constructor removed; only Logger(Serilog.ILogger) remains.
  * Default file layout is now a single rolling log.txt; set SeparateFilesPerLevel = true to restore the old layout.

Full changelog: https://github.com/IoannTerrible/Serilog.TechTeaStudio.Wrap/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
		</PackageReleaseNotes>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<PropertyGroup>
		<PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions" Version="10.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Binder" Version="10.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection" Version="10.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging" Version="10.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Serilog" Version="4.2.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Serilog.Extensions.Logging" Version="9.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Serilog.Formatting.Compact" Version="3.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Serilog.Sinks.Console" Version="6.0.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Serilog.Sinks.File" Version="6.0.0" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="..\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\CHANGELOG.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\LICENSE.txt" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
